00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.290
Thank God for new models.

00:17:34.290 --> 00:17:37.700
The shock absorbers kick in 
much faster than the others!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:40.800
This is the police.

00:17:40.800 --> 00:17:43.130
You are currently charged with 
destruction of property

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:46.230
and obstruction of justice!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.090
Further, the sensors are picking up drug use!

00:17:49.090 --> 00:17:50.670
God, I can't see anything!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:51.630
<b>Warning: Heart Rate Elevated. 
Please Calm Down and Take a Deep Breath. 

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:52.670
Kyoukai-kun!

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:55.410
I'm getting rid of the pop-ups on this end.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:56.550
Just a bit longer.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.180
Where's Yamabuki-kun?

00:18:02.170 --> 00:18:03.180
Yamabuki-kun?

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:09.160
They're going away!

00:18:09.160 --> 00:18:09.690
All right.

00:18:10.510 --> 00:18:12.690
Activate Simulate Pattern Akatsuki!

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:22.700
Not bad.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:25.450
It's only simulation software, but still,

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.160
she's able to keep up.

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:33.170
There it is!

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:34.630
The capsule's release hatch!

00:18:36.330 --> 00:18:37.240
No way!

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:39.010
Send the data here.

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.230
Got it.

00:18:45.230 --> 00:18:47.270
Somehow, they've fortified this part alone.

00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:49.260
But why that one?

00:18:49.260 --> 00:18:52.470
They intended to use the capsule from the start?

00:18:59.560 --> 00:19:01.240
Why is she losing her cool?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.470
Sena-kun, stand by on-site.

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:04.240
Roger.

00:19:09.720 --> 00:19:13.390
Get... off...

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:13.390
Calm down!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.910
You read the manual, didn't you?

00:19:14.910 --> 00:19:16.920
Oh, right. A leg move...

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:19.300
Kick Dash Iota!

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.050
<b>Kick Dash Iota</b>

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:26.510
That's way too high.

00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:46.270
What about the people taking refuge inside?

00:19:44.380 --> 00:19:48.020
DSE system shutoff confirmed.

00:19:47.140 --> 00:19:48.840
The attacker is still alive!

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:51.550
Contact JR! There may be blackouts!

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.220
I... did this?

00:19:51.550 --> 00:19:54.220
Urgent message from Takawa 05 to Takawa HQ.

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:56.300
Takawa HQ, acknowledged.

00:19:55.280 --> 00:19:59.100
I admit I'd started to get my hopes up, 
but I guess I'll have to reassess.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:59.940
The Saitou Building has collapsed due 
to Unit 8 action for Directive 153.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.060
Backup requested.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.190
She passed, right?

00:20:01.060 --> 00:20:06.490
Takawa HQ to all units, cordon off the 
Saitou Building and minimize access.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.510
She adapted to unforeseen circumstances,

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.470
and produced results.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:09.230
We repeat, cordon off the Saitou Building...

00:20:06.770 --> 00:20:07.880
Well...

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:13.230
Um, are you okay?

00:20:15.200 --> 00:20:17.110
Oh, yes...

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:19.010
Thank you.

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.880
You saved me.

00:20:20.880 --> 00:20:22.310
N-No problem.

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:26.150
I'll take her to the hospital, just in case.

00:20:26.550 --> 00:20:28.200
Keep up the good work.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.470
Oh, is it okay for you to be here?

00:20:39.310 --> 00:20:41.560
Keep your chin up, Oscar VI.

00:20:41.560 --> 00:20:43.930
That building had been evacuated.

00:20:44.780 --> 00:20:45.820
I see...

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:47.120
Let's go home.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:50.470
I failed, didn't I?

00:20:50.870 --> 00:20:52.030
Why?

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.150
Why?

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:58.480
As a police officer of justice, 
my actions were inexcusable!

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.740
Don't worry.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.150
Police officers aren't just.

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.030
Huh?

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:07.690
It's fine for you to be just.

00:21:07.690 --> 00:21:11.180
But what we should protect is the law.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.910
Don't bring personal justice into the workplace.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:20.070
You'll be disciplined in due course.

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:27.890
That proved more fruitful than anticipated.

00:21:28.210 --> 00:21:31.480
Perhaps we'll throw more obstacles at Unit 8.

00:21:31.780 --> 00:21:33.890
Perhaps they will become our enemies...

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:35.740
Enemies?

00:21:36.350 --> 00:21:38.020
Enemies of Logos?

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:42.030
Talk about clichéd.

00:21:47.100 --> 00:21:48.990
Hinata, are you okay?

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:51.100
Oh, Sis...

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:52.700
Sorry for the scare.

00:21:52.970 --> 00:21:56.460
I was so shocked to get a call 
from the police station.

00:21:56.730 --> 00:21:57.870
I'm sorry.

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.590
But I'm okay.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:02.930
Oh, there is one thing I'm worried about.

00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:03.590
What?

00:22:04.120 --> 00:22:08.050
Who's going to make you breakfast tomorrow?

00:22:09.420 --> 00:22:10.980
Silly!

00:23:50.070 --> 00:23:51.950
