Huh? What's going on?

00:23:56.150 --> 00:23:58.350
Everyone's just drinking nonstop.

00:23:58.350 --> 00:23:59.300
Whoa!

00:23:59.300 --> 00:24:01.150
Did Kazari-san make a 
surprising career change?

00:24:01.150 --> 00:24:04.910
What does the episode title, 
"Challenge From the Arena," mean?
